<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Re builds 0.75 pct INA stake.</title>
<headline>Swiss Re builds 0.75 pct INA stake.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Reinsurance Co said it had built up a 0.75 percent stake in Italy's Instituto Nazionale delle Assicurazoni SpA (INA) through open-market share purchases.</p>
<p>&quot;In recent weeks Swiss Re has acquired 0.75 percent of INA's share capital on the Milan Stock Exchange and so has become one of the leading non-Italian shareholders in INA,&quot; Swiss Re said in a statement announcing its agreement to acquire  Unione Italiana di Riassicurazione SpA from INA.</p>
<p>INA and Swis Re also agreed closer co-operation in other areas of business.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
